{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קְטל","hw":"קְטל","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קְטל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. slay (</strong>𝔗 Syriac (often); v. BH (late, rare)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָטֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:19\" href=\"/Daniel.5.19\">Dn 5:19</a>, acc. pers. <strong>Peʿîl</strong> <em>be slain:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְטִיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:30\" href=\"/Daniel.5.30\">5:30</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְטִילַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:11\" href=\"/Daniel.7.11\">7:11</a>.<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  <em>slay:</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַטִּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:22\" href=\"/Daniel.3.22\">3:22</a> (acc. pers.); Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְקַטָּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:14\" href=\"/Daniel.2.14\">2:14</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> acc. pers.).<br><strong>Hithpe.</strong>  <em>be slain:</em> Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהִתְקְטָלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:13\" href=\"/Daniel.2.13\">2:13</a>; Pt. (= gerundive, K<sup>§ 76, 3</sup>) pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתְקַטְלִין</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:13\" href=\"/Daniel.2.13\">13</a> were <em>to be slain</em>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, קטר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קַיָּם"}